OL,3,GNEWSASerial fly-tipper tracked down and
OL,4,Aprosecuted
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fly-tipper who repeatedly dumped
OL,7,Ftrolleys full of rubbish in Ilford,
OL,8,Feast London, has been ordered to pay a
OL,9,Ftotal of #1,019 in fines and costs and
OL,10,Fgiven a community order.
OL,12,FCarmen Vasile, 45, pleaded guilty at
OL,13,FBarkingside Magistrates' Court in
OL,14,FSeptember to three counts of
OL,15,Ffly-tipping.
OL,17,FShe had previously been given multiple
OL,18,Fwarnings by enforcement officers and a
OL,19,Flegal notice telling her how to dispose
OL,20,Fof household waste. After a fixed
OL,21,Fpenalty notice went unpaid, the council
OL,22,Ftook legal action.
OL,23,APub: 14-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
