OL,3,GNEWSASerial fly-tipper tracked down and
OL,4,Aprosecuted
OL,5,
OL,6,FCouncillor Sunny Brar, Redbridge's
OL,7,Fcabinet member for enforcement, said:
OL,8,F"This prosecution should serve as a
OL,9,Fwarning that we have zero tolerance for
OL,10,Ffly-tipping in Redbridge."
